WEBVTT

00:00:02.040 --> 00:00:07.000
Wu's Lü Meng was a general with a total commitment
to valor in his younger days.

00:00:07.330 --> 00:00:10.290
Sun Quan, thinking that Lü Meng would
become even more polished

00:00:10.290 --> 00:00:12.330
if he were to pursue scholarly knowledge,

00:00:12.330 --> 00:00:14.630
recommended that the he devote himself to studying.

00:00:15.080 --> 00:00:17.040
In accordance with Sun Quan's design,

00:00:17.040 --> 00:00:20.290
Lü Meng's talent bloomed through
the pursuit of knowledge, as well.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:25.460
Lu Su, who was astonished by this,
extoled he was no longer that Ah-Meng from Wu.

00:00:25.750 --> 00:00:27.210
And it is said that Lü Meng replied,

00:00:27.210 --> 00:00:32.380
"A scholar you've not seen for three days
should be looked at with fresh eyes."

00:00:28.080 --> 00:00:29.460
<b>A scholar you've not seen for three days</b>

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:38.710
<b>A scholar you've not seen for three days</b>

00:00:29.460 --> 00:00:38.710
<b>should be looked at with fresh eyes.</b>

00:00:32.830 --> 00:00:37.130
Indeed, people can develop with astounding speed.

00:00:37.670 --> 00:00:39.210
And in modern-day Shibuya, too,

00:00:39.210 --> 00:00:42.750
there are a singer and a rapper who
have achieved amazing growth.

00:00:42.920 --> 00:00:44.790
<i>I will represent those guys.</i>

00:00:44.790 --> 00:00:47.250
<i>I'll represent everybody who's like me and them.</i>

00:00:47.580 --> 00:00:51.960
The rapper Kabetaijin once again came
eye to eye with Sekitoba Kung Fu.

00:00:52.580 --> 00:00:54.380
<i>I wonder if I can become like that too?</i>

00:00:54.380 --> 00:00:57.380
<i>Someone who'll astound people
when they see me again.</i>

00:00:57.630 --> 00:00:59.330
<i>That kind of singer...</i>

00:00:59.670 --> 00:01:05.130
The singer Eiko sang in hopes of reaching Nanami,
the friend from whom her path had diverged.

00:01:06.210 --> 00:01:11.710
And her singing ended up causing Kongming
to recall his master Liu Bei.

00:01:12.250 --> 00:01:14.250
<i>A dream of peace throughout the world...</i>

00:01:14.580 --> 00:01:17.210
<i>The one who brought me on this unending journey...</i>

00:01:17.420 --> 00:01:20.420
<i>was you, my lord.</i>

00:01:21.250 --> 00:01:25.000
